                <pb facs="0536" n="456" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg456"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President to the King.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Executive Mansion</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-11-15"><hi rendition="#italic">November 15,
                        1901</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I congratulate Your Majesty on this auspicious anniversary.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Theodore
                    Roosevelt.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
